先说战果，积分几千分，成本我控制在一分2u左右，虽然比不上很多老哥们，但是基于我没有工作室，所以结果我还是比较满意的

但是比起结果，我更想跟大家分享的是我从4月份正式分享lighter以来的故事</span> <button class="max-w-full text-[length:inherit] font-normal text-brand hover:underline" type="button">Show more</button></div></div></div><div class="mx-auto relative overflow-hidden" style="aspect-ratio:1.2461059190031152"><div class="relative h-full w-full"><div inert="" class="h-full w-full"><a class="rounded-xs focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-ring max-w-full text-[length:inherit] font-[inherit] block h-full w-full cursor-zoom-in appearance-none border-none bg-transparent p-0 text-inherit" aria-label="Image" href="/c_dylanber/status/2005896403852398602/photo/1"><img fetchPriority="low" height="963" width="1200" alt="" class="w-full" decoding="async" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 600px) calc(100vw - 80px), 600px" src="https://pbs.twimg.com/media/G9ZgJDpaYAQ9rZ-?format=webp&amp;name=large" srcSet="https://pbs.twimg.com/media/G9ZgJDpaYAQ9rZ-?format=webp&amp;name=small 680w, https://pbs.twimg.com/media/G9ZgJDpaYAQ9rZ-?format=webp&amp;name=medium 1200w, https://pbs.twimg.com/media/G9ZgJDpaYAQ9rZ-?format=webp&amp;name=large 2048w"/></a></div><a aria-label="View media" class="absolute inset-0 z-10" href="/c_dylanber/status/2005896403852398602/photo/1"></a></div></div></article></div></div><div class="flex shrink items-center text-gray-700"><span class="inline-flex w-fit"><a id="_R_bqppimb6b5336_" data-base-ui-tooltip-trigger="" class="font-chirp max-w-full whitespace-pre-wrap break-words text-gray-700 text-body font-normal hover:underline inline-flex w-fit" href="/KuiGas/status/2005993706747486719">1:25 PM · Dec 30, 2025</a><script nonce="qRaPMZanhPidGeq7Gz/w3Q==">window.__xClientTextFormatters?.run("_R_bqppimb6b5336_", "formatFullTimestamp", {"timestamp":1767101143000,"lang":"en","nowLabel":"Now"});</script></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="shrink-0 px-1 last:hidden">·</span><a class="rounded-xs focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline